message: "本プレプリントを引用する場合は、以下を参照してください。 / If you cite this preprint, please use the following."
type: article

title: "No error was raised: twenty-six broken measurements from a cross-domain audit of free satellite data"

abstract: >-
  Published work on satellite applications is, with few exceptions, a collection
  of successes. What free Earth observation cannot do, and where the attempt to
  measure whether it can do it breaks down, is largely absent from the record.

  Fifteen advertised industrial applications of satellite data were implemented
  in full, fixed to a single region so that results are comparable, and run on
  free, unauthenticated data only. Nine were then scored against reference
  solutions that cannot be moved by the authors: awarded national-government
  contracts recovered from thirteen fiscal years of Japanese procurement open
  data (312,584 records, 332 of them satellite analysis work). The remaining six
  were not measured because the state does not buy them — four industries
  returned zero analysis contracts in 312,584 records.

  Seven technical walls and four institutional walls are reported, and only one
  of the seven is bought off with money. Two are properties of the measuring
  instrument rather than of the method, including a thermal sensor whose
  overpass time has been drifting since orbit maintenance ended, bending a
  night-time temperature trend from +0.083 to +0.812 K/yr. One is not a
  technical wall at all: a satellite quantity can be measured correctly and add
  nothing, because the target statistic is already explained by population.

  The core of the paper is a ledger of twenty-six occasions on which the
  measurement itself was broken. Every one returned a plausible value without
  raising an error, and ten returned a good result. The asymmetry that bad
  results are doubted while good ones are not is identified as the central
  hazard of self-directed measurement, and the protocol freezes a prediction, a
  decision criterion and a counter-hypothesis before each run so that a
  confirmed prediction is also audited.

  衛星データ用途15業種を福岡に固定して全部実装し、国の落札実績を参照解に9業種を採点した。
  技術の壁7種・制度の壁4種、そして測り方が壊れていた26件の台帳。英語本文と日本語完全版。

